# SMB Owner Environment Variables

# AI-Powered Merchant Categorization — Google Gemini (FREE)
# Get your free API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/
# Free tier: 15 requests/min, 1M tokens/day
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# AI-Powered Batch Categorization — Anthropic Claude Haiku (optional)
# Enables AI categorization for unknown transactions during bulk upload
# Get your key from: https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_key_here

# NOTE: The app works 100% without API keys!
# Built-in keyword matching handles most common merchants automatically.
# AI keys improve accuracy for unusual/niche merchants.

# Passkey Authentication (Optional — server-side, hash is never sent to the browser)
# Generate SHA-256 hash: node -e "const c=require('crypto');process.stdout.write(c.createHash('sha256').update('yourpassword').digest('hex'))"
# PASSKEY_HASH=your_sha256_hash_here
